note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note CUDApp#55 schedule perturbation admission. The evaluator validates every frozen row before any
note fork; a refused row never runs. Reason codes (docs/abft/CONTRACT.md section 7):
note 0 accepted, 1 unknown policy, 2 target worker out of range, 3 atomic site unsupported (69),
note 4 device instruction-stream site unsupported: no qualified delay opcode (69),
note 5 wait removal without the known-bad control label, 6 shape or worker bounds, 7 transposed index
note fault on a non-square shape, 8 delay policy without a site, 9 hang control with one worker.
fn sreason to ulong
m = kf KM
n = kf KN
k = kf KK
w = kf KW
if gt kf KPOL 3
ret 1
end
if ge kf KPOL 2
if ge kf KTGT w
ret 2
end
end
if eq kf KSITE 4
ret 3
end
if gt kf KSITE 4
ret 4
end
if eq kf KFLT 5
if eq and kf KFLG 2 0
ret 5
end
end
if or eq w 0 gt w 64
ret 6
end
if or or eq m 0 gt m 256 or eq n 0 gt n 256
ret 6
end
if or eq k 0 gt k 256
ret 6
end
if fis 4 2
if ne n k
ret 7
end
end
if eq kf KPOL 3
if eq kf KSITE 0
ret 8
end
end
if eq kf KFLT 5
if eq kf KSUB 4
if lt w 2
ret 9
end
end
end
ret 0
end
fn sstatus r ulong to ulong
if eq r 0
ret 0
end
if or eq r 3 eq r 4
ret 69
end
ret 65
end
